        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've lost all humanity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we still reach Blaze, Doctor, and GreyThroat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. Keep in touch with them. Help them find their way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Thirsty howling).",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't feel... anything from you anymore. That faint outline of a thread of hatred, it all came from Mephisto...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to cleanse it... the poison of Mephisto's hate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promise. I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've finished mopping up the Reunion stragglers and reached the waypoint. But we've found the situation in the slums is not what we expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The L. G. D. unit guarding the area found no traces of Reunion. I'm going to have to investigate myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's been a reduction in the Infected mutants? Is that your doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "No?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay frosty... You never know what danger might be hiding in the shadows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let your guard down. These Infected are a lot more to handle than your run-of-the-mill Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once I finish my work here, I'll send a team to assist you. Keep the channel open. Over and out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me! Reporting in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing. Report in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Sir! As ordered, we swept the area!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you find?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing! Not a single Reunion footprint to be found!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you to be on the lookout for anything unusual!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Oops. We really don't know this area at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, according to procedure, we don't come in here until there's a problem so serious we have to tear down a block or something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... The slums don't exist to you, as long as they're quiet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When we cut off Reunion, there was a deafening sound coming from this place, and half the residents here vanished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the toys scattered around our feet... Look at this and tell me there's nothing out of the ordinary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was there anything in the plan about evacuating all the residents of the slums?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...There are a few things out of the ordinary. Most of the buildings in the district have been abandoned or otherwise ruined.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The streets that are still here are completely empty. Presumably a result of crossfire between Reunion and the locals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there have been a few fires. We have extinguished them. They seem to have been caused by household functions such as heating and cooking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "All buildings show signs of forced entry, but there is no trace of any resistance from the residents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for Reunion, there's really no sign of them at all. Just... some cleaning residue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you care nothing for the civilians here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry, Sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you apologizing for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know, Sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever... Why should you care about anyone in a place like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up and send out some teams to lock down the area!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one gets in or out. No vehicles either. Reunion or otherwise!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you... You come with me. We're going north.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Shh. Don't make a sound!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This way. Quickly.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very perceptive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Preparing to fire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You should not follow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Control your subordinates, Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go find Swire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Sir...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who sent you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not answer to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You think you can run? Try and I'll arrest you on the spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're an unidentified armed element of unknown origin. How do you think the L. G. D. is going to treat you? We might just shoot you dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Training a new L. G. D. unit would be a waste of Lungmen's time, treasure, and talent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "And eradicating the entire L. G. D. would be a crushing blow to the heart of the Lungmen community. You should not take the risk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! Is that threat supposed to scare me? Or should I be thanking you for your concern over Lungmen's future?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, the L. G. D. is the face of Lungmen, as well as a pillar of her community, and an exemplary show of her strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the L. G. D. should stay in its lane.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let it stick its nose where it doesn't belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your threats are really not impressing me. Hurry up and answer the question: where did all the locals go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're one tap of this 'alert all units' button away from making an enemy out of the entire L. G. D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or I guess you could take a split second to knock away my sword, slice off my arm, and snatch away this transceiver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did all the slum dwellers go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We will withdraw from this place. Ch'en, you and I both withdraw. For now, let us not interfere with one another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And where is it you think you're going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "These new-type Infected Reunion is controlling may well interfere with our carefully laid plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will swiftly remove them for the L. G. D., please do your part to exterminate Reunion's main force.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the L. G. D. seeks to actualize its strategic goals, it should focus on its own duties. You must do that which you must do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! You think you can just leave?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come and go as you please?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Superintendent Ch'en, let me give you a suggestion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not seek to investigate what has happened here. I look to Lord Wei, and will banter with you no longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, cutting off your arm is quite simple. When you stand resolute, you are a hundred times stronger than now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay back, Swire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Get back here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will see myself out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that all about? Who was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen's special forces are on the move. And I don't know if the people of this district are piled in a mass grave somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What are you talking about...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't play dumb. You know. Or at least you've heard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Know what...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, do you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know. But your grandfather definitely knows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Seriously, what are we even talking about? Diu ah! Just come out with it already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "My grandpa's totally bedridden. I can't get two words out of him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Being sick in bed means he can't run Lungmen anymore? You know better than I what kind of man your grandfather is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you thinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'Lin Gray.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Now I'm the one who gets to say 'no way!' Lin runs the slums as his personal fief. There's no way he'd let something like this happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Make a few phone calls and ask around. Maybe you'll find out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you calling? Or should I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
